OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of properties hit by
OL,4,Apower cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of properties in Greater
OL,7,FManchester and Lancashire have been hit
OL,8,Fby power cuts caused by "an unexpected
OL,9,Fincident with [an] underground cable".
OL,11,FSP Electricity North West (SPENW) said
OL,12,Fproperties in Oldham, Rochdale,
OL,13,FSalford, Blackpool, Lancaster,
OL,14,FMyerscough and Bilsborrow and North
OL,15,FMeols had been affected.
OL,17,FSPENW apologised for the disruption,
OL,18,Fsaying that about 279 properties in
OL,19,FMyerscough and Bilsborrow in Lancashire
OL,20,Fhad since been reconnected.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
